[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taiki-e/cargo-llvm-cov/issues/comments/5554153540","html_url":"https://github.com/taiki-e/cargo-llvm-cov/issues/513#issuecomment-5554153540","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taiki-e/cargo-llvm-cov/issues/513","id":5554153540,"node_id":"IC_kwDOE66iB88AAAABSw2oRA","user":{"login":"taiki-e","id":43724913,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNzI0OTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43724913?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e","html_url":"https://github.com/taiki-e","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-05T19:12:19Z","updated_at":"2026-09-05T19:14:23Z","body":"The issue here is that compatibility with specific versions of LLVM tools depends on the version of the Rust toolchain being used.\n\nIt would be fine to check the version of the LLVM tool in the PATH and fall back to it if it is compatible. However, unconditional fallback to the LLVM tool in the PATH is not an acceptable approach because it can cause crashes that are hard to debug.\n\nSee also https://github.com/taiki-e/cargo-llvm-cov/issues/379","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taiki-e/cargo-llvm-cov/issues/comments/5554153540/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taiki-e/cargo-llvm-cov/issues/comments/5556189548","html_url":"https://github.com/taiki-e/cargo-llvm-cov/issues/513#issuecomment-5556189548","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taiki-e/cargo-llvm-cov/issues/513","id":5556189548,"node_id":"IC_kwDOE66iB88AAAABSyy5bA","user":{"login":"Scott-Nx","id":158021536,"node_id":"U_kgDOCWs3oA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158021536?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scott-Nx","html_url":"https://github.com/Scott-Nx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scott-Nx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scott-Nx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scott-Nx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scott-Nx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scott-Nx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scott-Nx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scott-Nx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scott-Nx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scott-Nx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-06T01:52:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-06T01:52:44Z","body":"I think the safest implementation would be a narrowly scoped fallback:\n\nOnly for a non-rustup toolchain where the sysroot tools are missing, look for both `llvm-cov` and `llvm-profdata` in `PATH`.\n\n- Before using them, compare the LLVM version reported by the active `rustc` with the versions reported by both tools.\n- Only accept when all three versions match exactly; otherwise keep the current failure behavior.\n\nPATH lookup itself can be done directly in Rust. The only additional process invocations would be the version probes (`rustc -vV`, `llvm-cov --version`, and `llvm-profdata --version`), and those only happen on this fallback path.\n\nI think we should treat `llvm-cov` and `llvm-profdata` as an atomic pair rather than allowing one tool to come from the sysroot and the other from `PATH`.\n\nIf this approach sounds good to you, I can try implementing it and open a PR.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taiki-e/cargo-llvm-cov/issues/comments/5556189548/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taiki-e/cargo-llvm-cov/issues/comments/5560770478","html_url":"https://github.com/taiki-e/cargo-llvm-cov/issues/513#issuecomment-5560770478","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taiki-e/cargo-llvm-cov/issues/513","id":5560770478,"node_id":"IC_kwDOE66iB88AAAABS3Kfrg","user":{"login":"taiki-e","id":43724913,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNzI0OTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43724913?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e","html_url":"https://github.com/taiki-e","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taiki-e/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-06T17:02:47Z","updated_at":"2026-09-06T17:02:47Z","body":"That sounds like a reasonable approach. I would accept a PR to implement it.","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taiki-e/cargo-llvm-cov/issues/comments/5560770478/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]